---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SmartCalculator from '../components/SmartCalculator.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <SmartCalculator />

    <!-- SEO Content Section for Google Ranking -->
    <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-12 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm text-slate-800 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-3">
        Ghar Ke Bijli Bill Ki Calculation Kaise Hoti Hai?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        Bijli ka bill aapke ghar me use hone wale total units (kWh) par tay hota hai. <strong>1 Unit ka matlab hota hai 1000 Watts ka load 1 ghante tak chalna.</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-xs font-mono">
        Units (kWh) = (Appliance Watts × Quantity × Daily Hours × 30 Din) ÷ 1000
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Heavy Appliances Ka Bijli Kharcha:</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <li><strong>Geyser (2000W):</strong> Rozana 1 ghanta chalne par mahine me lagbhag 60 units khata hai (~₹480).</li>
        <li><strong>1.5 Ton Inverter AC:</strong> Rozana 8 ghante par mahine me 250 se 280 units (~₹2,200).</li>
        <li><strong>Induction Cooktop (1400W):</strong> Rozana 1.5 ghante par lagbhag 63 units (~₹500).</li>
        <li><strong>1 HP Water Motor (750W):</strong> Rozana 1 ghanta par lagbhag 22.5 units (~₹180).</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>